      "one 15-nearest-neighbour graph on obsm['scvi'], which is also the published connectivity",
      "the 1D, 2D and 3D UMAPs of that one graph",
      "gene symbols resolved through ensembl_to_hgnc.pickle, the var index; genes without one are not published, and the upstream accession is kept as var['ensembl_gene_id']"
    ]
  },
